    johnPeterGooley.note='Peter John Gooley’s surviving record connects a Quebec-born man with Ontario and Michigan, Mary Ann Dennis, and their daughter Ida Mae. The K856-QYW profile is the 1847 candidate/mismatch and does not prove the reported 2 May 1842 birth. The surviving record shows one marriage to Mary Ann Dennis; no evidence of plural marriage has been found.';
